    "regime_notes": "10-day IC was -0.0572 over 2023-11-13 to 2025-12-31, then positive: 0.0504 (2026-2028), 0.0366 (2029-2031), 0.0443 (2032-2035-10-23). Early negative regime warrants conservative interpretation.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_1_20351025_dispersion_gated_residual_reversal_signal.csv"
